    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "@feltanimalworld @hashshilang @howie_serious 但求和平吧。\n\n到了乱世，那种类似于驻宗族的“共同体”会显得非常重要。目前，任何地方的原子化个体都缺乏对灾难的抵抗力",
